          },
          "description": "<ul><li><strong>AI Agent Orchestration:</strong> Developed and deployed autonomous AI agents using Google GenAI SDK and MCP, orchestrating multi-step Docker and system-level workflows via natural language reasoning.</li><li><strong>Product Strategy &amp; Execution:</strong> Direct end-to-end product strategy for cybersecurity portfolio including 'Advance Cyber Kiosk' and 'Dorje' OT SIEM, ensuring alignment with market demands and business goals.</li><li><strong>DevOps Engineering:</strong> Design and implement enterprise DevOps infrastructure using Proxmox virtualization, QEMU/KVM, and automated CI/CD pipelines with Jenkins and Docker orchestration.</li><li><strong>Infrastructure &amp; Security:</strong> Configure enterprise-grade routers, firewalls, and OpenSource VPN solutions; implement Snort-based intrusion detection and system hardening protocols.</li><li><strong>Cross-Functional Leadership:</strong> Lead and synchronize efforts across DevOps, Network Administration, Operations, and Customer Success teams; conduct Angular and .NET code reviews.</li><li><strong>Client &amp; Vendor Management:</strong> Handle client meetings, product deployments, vendor coordination, and ensure delivery of technical solutions aligned with revenue targets.</li><li><strong>Monitoring &amp; Automation:</strong> Deploy Grafana and Prometheus for comprehensive infrastructure monitoring; create Bash automation scripts for operational efficiency.</li></ul>",
          "roles": []
        },
